## Third-party data

This licence covers the code in this repository only.

- `data/raw/` — OpenADMET / Octant Bio CYP release, **CC-BY-4.0**, redistributed
  here unmodified with attribution. See `data/raw/SOURCE.md`.
- `data/external/` — ZINC20 tranches, **not redistributed**. ZINC permits sharing
  the results of a screen but not major portions of the database itself, so these
  files are gitignored and regenerated locally by `scripts/fetch_zinc.sh`.
